<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoEngineDestroy"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoEngineDestroy</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoEngineDestroy</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to clean-up a <type>SilikoEngine</type></refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Engine.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoEngineDestroy(SilikoEngine *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoEngineDestroy</function> function deletes
<varname>object</varname>. Any functions installed in
<varname>object</varname> will be passed to
<function>SilikoFunctionDestroy</function>.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
